  "observations": [
    "Jammed revolver 1/6 and cleared 1/6 badges remain readable; held javelin hotbar count changes 1 -> 0 -> 1 after throw and recovery, while the bag revolver keeps 1/6.",
    "Industrial firearm badges show revolver 0/6 -> 6/6 -> 5/6 and rifle 5/5 -> 4/5; bag revolver remains 5/6.",
    "At 1366x768 the rifle HUD badge and both inventory gun counts stay within the viewport; the foreground inventory overlaps part of the log by normal window stacking.",
    "Both common title layouts show the original art and a visible start button; common non-firearm loadout has no firearm ammo badge.",
    "Some view_image previews appeared partially black, but the original RGB PNG regions contain the status, tools, sidebars, inventory and log pixels. This review does not classify those preview artifacts as product defects."
  ],
